# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# THIS REPO IS CODE ONLY. Your coursework data stays on your machine.
#
# Everything below is per-student and must never be committed:
#   - names, student numbers, email addresses
#   - course ids and enrolment, which identifies which courses you take
#   - raw authenticated HTML, which contains a live sesskey in the logout URL
#
# If you ever paste a dump into a bug report, strip it first.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# tracker store: assignments, marks, identity, per-course folders
cw-data/
cw-data-*/

# raw page captures from the authenticated session
.cw/

# Working folders created by `cwtrack brief`, and rendered deliverables.
# Scoped to a few directories on purpose: a bare `*.pdf` or `*.html` also swallows
# the test fixtures, and the suite then fails on every fresh clone because the
# tests run on nothing. Generated files live in known places, so name those.
work/
briefs/
output/
reports/
rendered/

# Only the dashboard, which is generated into the store and already ignored by
# cw-data/ below. Test fixtures under tests/fixtures/ must stay tracked.
index.html

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Safety net, and it has to come after the negations above.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Raw captures anywhere, whatever the directory is called.
**/dump/**/*.html
captcha*.png
*_sesskey*

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# secrets — belt and braces. Nothing above should get this far.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
*.env
secrets.json
token.txt
*.token
captcha.png
captcha_answer.txt
cookies.json
session.json

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# python
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# editors / os
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# node, if you ever add a frontend
node_modules/